My overarching goal is 1) to estimate linear growth of multiple latent factors across time, and 2) to estimate the correlation between their respective linear growth factors.

My model is composed of the following latent factors:

-2nd order factor, "top," which is composed of three subfactors, "pa", "na," and "fa." Each of the subfactors are estimated using between 3-5 items each
