That is an outdated document.  You cannot obtain modification indices for estimated parameters using modindices() anymore (for several years now).

You can obtain them for equality-constrained parameters from the more general score-test function:

lavTestScore(model3)

To see which parameters the printed parameter labels refer to, see your parameter table:

parTable(model3)

You will notice the score tests are not identical to the old document, but the same 2 indicators are flagged for having unequal intercepts.

